{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c2a44ce8-391a-896d-862a-2ee52781a5c2",
  "created_at": "2025-12-21T16:10:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leo Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:08:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:08:12-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin, honey, this is Leo Conti. I know it's Sunday afternoon, and City Hall's closed, so I figured this is the line for it. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:08:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you got the right place. This line's open when the office isn't. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:08:28-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'll tell you, I was out in the driveway this morning with my coffee, and there's a puddle sitting right there on the apron, down at the bottom, and it just runs toward the garage door. It's been three days since that soaker, Wednesday into Thursday, and it's still sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:08:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so standing water at the end of the driveway. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:08:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "96 Ayrault Street, up on the Hill. And I've been here a good while, dear, and it was not this bad last winter. We got rain, sure, but it drained. Now it just sits and creeps up toward the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:09:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Ninety-six Ayrault. Is there a storm drain close by, like at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:09:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's one down the street a bit, I think. It looks all packed with leaves, but I can't swear to it. Hang on, Kevin, I've got my grandfather's old radio going in the next room, let me hear you. [pause] Okay, that's better, I'm out on the porch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:09:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. So that's the drain near you, maybe clogged with leaves, and water pooling at the apron toward the garage. Writing that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:09:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And here's my question. Is that a city drain or a state one? Because somebody told me some of the streets around here belong to the state, and I don't want to be calling the wrong people again and again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:09:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ayrault's a city street as far as I know, so the drain on it should be ours. If it turns out to be a state one, we'd pass it along ourselves. You wouldn't have to chase it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:09:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's good. I'd just like somebody to come look at it, honey. It's a nuisance, and it keeps getting worse every time it rains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:10:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in a work order for a crew to check and clear that drain. Can I get a callback number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:10:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0193."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:10:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-three. Got it. Crews will probably get to it early in the week, depending on what else came in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:10:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you, Kevin. I'll keep an eye on that puddle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T16:10:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You do that. Have a good rest of your Sunday, Leo."
    }
  ],
